<codeline lineno="26"><highlight class="comment"><sp/><sp/><sp/>5)<sp/>For<sp/>SgExpression<sp/>objects,<sp/>if<sp/>the<sp/>expression<sp/>is<sp/>an<sp/>operator,<sp/>then<sp/>the<sp/>position<sp/>location<sp/>of</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="27"><highlight class="comment"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>the<sp/>operator<sp/>need<sp/>be<sp/>set.<sp/><sp/>The<sp/>operator<sp/>position<sp/>is<sp/>optional,<sp/>so<sp/>need<sp/>not<sp/>be<sp/>set<sp/>for<sp/></highlight></codeline>
